              "text": ", while a smaller and more understated destination, offers a unique culinary experience that reflects the simplicity and authenticity of local Egyptian life. While the town may not boast high-end tourist restaurants, its charm lies in the local supermarkets and small eateries that provide a genuine taste of the region’s cuisine."
